WEBVTT

00:08:26.413 --> 00:08:30.079
A onda smo imali 
eksperiment sa srebrnim volom.

00:08:32.829 --> 00:08:35.287
I Katy Perry pije jutarnju kavu

00:08:35.454 --> 00:08:38.662
iz žute sove.

00:08:39.204 --> 00:08:40.829
Hvala, Katy, za ovu fotografiju.

00:08:41.121 --> 00:08:42.621
Oh, ima još nešto, još nešto.

00:08:42.704 --> 00:08:46.162
Mislim da ste magarca
obojili crveno, Gwen.

00:08:46.537 --> 00:08:47.871
Dame i gospodo, ruke gore

00:08:47.871 --> 00:08:50.162
ako ste pročitali 
“Don Quijotea”.

00:08:50.246 --> 00:08:51.996
Tko je pročitao “Don Quijotea”?

00:08:52.121 --> 00:08:53.162
(Smijeh)

00:08:53.621 --> 00:08:55.954
Čekajte, čekajte, ima još, ima još.

00:08:56.287 --> 00:08:58.996
Gwen, bio sam tako siguran

00:08:59.496 --> 00:09:01.246
da ćete baš tako birati